Abaixo está uma versão completa, responsiva e reorganizada. A interface foi dividida em 3 etapas para reduzir a sobrecarga visual, removendo textos repetidos, o botão Google e o cartão escolar excessivamente longo. O código inclui validação, seleção de perfil, seleção de escola, confirmação de senha e estado de sucesso.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-AO">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="Criação de conta institucional SIGRE">
  <title>SIGRE — Criar conta</title>

  <style>
    :root {
      --coral: #f4514a;
      --coral-dark: #d9403b;
      --navy: #062a3d;
      --navy-soft: #0b3b51;
      --ink: #173047;
      --muted: #728297;
      --line: #dbe4ec;
      --line-dark: #c7d3df;
      --surface: #ffffff;
      --soft: #f5f8fb;
      --soft-blue: #edf5f9;
      --success: #168568;
      --warning: #a86900;
      --danger: #c43d36;
      --shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(17, 48, 72, 0.12);
      --radius: 10px;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      min-width: 320px;
      margin: 0;
      background: #f2f5f8;
      color: var(--ink);
      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    button,
    input,
    select {
      font: inherit;
    }

    button,
    a,
    select {
      -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
    }

    button {
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    a {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    [hidden] {
      display: none !important;
    }

    svg {
      width: 18px;
      height: 18px;
      stroke-width: 1.9;
      flex: 0 0 auto;
    }

    .topbar {
      min-height: 72px;
      background: var(--coral);
    }

    .topbar-inner {
      width: min(100% - 40px, 1240px);
      min-height: 72px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .brand {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 11px;
      color: var(--navy);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .brand-mark {
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      border-radius: 11px;
      background: #ffffff;
      color: var(--navy);
      box-shadow: 0 5px 12px rgba(58, 31, 29, 0.13);
    }

    .brand-mark svg {
      width: 23px;
      height: 23px;
    }

    .brand-name strong {
      font-weight: 900;
    }

    .topbar-actions {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 18px;
      color: var(--navy);
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .login-link {
      min-height: 42px;
      padding: 0 18px;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: var(--navy);
      color: #ffffff;
      transition: transform 160ms ease, background 160ms ease;
    }

    .login-link:hover {
      background: var(--navy-soft);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    .page {
      width: min(100% - 40px, 1240px);
      margin: 32px auto 64px;
    }

    .register-shell {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(320px, 0.8fr) minmax(0, 1.2fr);
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      background: var(--surface);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .visual-panel {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 770px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: var(--navy);
    }

    .visual-image {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      display: block;
      object-fit: cover;
      object-position: center;
      filter: saturate(0.82);
    }

    .visual-cover {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: rgba(3, 34, 49, 0.58);
    }

    .visual-copy {
      position: absolute;
      right: 42px;
      bottom: 42px;
      left: 42px;
      z-index: 1;
      max-width: 360px;
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    .visual-label {
      display: inline-flex;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      color: #b9d2dc;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    }

    .visual-copy h2 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: clamp(28px, 3vw, 42px);
      line-height: 1.08;
      letter-spacing: 0;
    }

    .visual-copy h2 span {
      color: #ffb0aa;
    }

    .visual-copy p {
      max-width: 300px;
      margin: 17px 0 0;
      color: #e3edf1;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .form-panel {
      min-width: 0;
      padding: 42px clamp(26px, 4vw, 58px) 30px;
    }

    .form-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 9px;
      color: var(--coral-dark);
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.13em;
    }

    .form-header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--navy);
      font-size: clamp(28px, 3vw, 36px);
      line-height: 1.08;
      letter-spacing: 0;
    }

    .form-subtitle {
      max-width: 410px;
      margin: 10px 0 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .step-count {
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      padding-top: 7px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .step-count strong {
      color: var(--navy);
    }

    .progress {
      margin: 31px 0 38px;
    }

    .progress-list {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 12px;
      padding: 0;
      margin: 0;
      list-style: none;
    }

    .progress-step {
      position: relative;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 9px;
      min-width: 0;
      padding-bottom: 14px;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .progress-step::after {
      position: absolute;
      right: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      left: 0;
      height: 3px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      background: var(--line);
      content: "";
    }

    .progress-step.is-active,
    .progress-step.is-complete {
      color: var(--navy);
    }

    .progress-step.is-active::after,
    .progress-step.is-complete::after {
      background: var(--coral);
    }

    .progress-dot {
      width: 27px;
      height: 27px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      border: 1px solid var(--line-dark);
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #ffffff;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .progress-step.is-active .progress-dot,
    .progress-step.is-complete .progress-dot {
      border-color: var(--coral);
      background: var(--coral);
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    .progress-copy {
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .progress-copy strong,
    .progress-copy small {
      display: block;
      overflow: hidden;
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .progress-copy strong {
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .progress-copy small {
      margin-top: 1px;
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    .step-heading {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 13px;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .step-number {
      width: 32px;
      height: 32px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: #fff0ee;
      color: var(--coral-dark);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 900;
    }

    .step-heading h2 {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--navy);
      font-size: 20px;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .step-heading p {
      margin: 5px 0 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .field-group {
      min-width: 0;
      padding: 0;
      margin: 0;
      border: 0;
    }

    .field-group + .field-group {
      padding-top: 28px;
      margin-top: 29px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .field-group legend {
      display: block;
      padding: 0;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      color: var(--navy);
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .choice-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .choice-grid--roles {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .choice-card {
      position: relative;
      min-width: 0;
      min-height: 73px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 11px;
      padding: 12px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: #ffffff;
      color: var(--ink);
      text-align: left;
      transition: border-color 160ms ease, background 160ms ease, transform 160ms ease;
    }

    .choice-card:hover {
      border-color: #99b4c5;
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    .choice-card.is-selected {
      border-color: var(--navy);
      background: var(--navy);
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    .choice-icon {
      width: 34px;
      height: 34px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: var(--soft-blue);
      color: var(--navy);
    }

    .choice-card.is-selected .choice-icon {
      background: var(--coral);
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    .choice-copy {
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .choice-copy strong,
    .choice-copy small {
      display: block;
      overflow: hidden;
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
    }

    .choice-copy strong {
      font-size: 13px;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .choice-copy small {
      margin-top: 3px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 11px;
      line-height: 1.25;
    }

    .choice-card.is-selected .choice-copy small {
      color: #d6e6ed;
    }

    .choice-check {
      width: 20px;
      height: 20px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      margin-left: auto;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 50%;
      color: transparent;
    }

    .choice-card.is-selected .choice-check {
      border-color: #ffffff;
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    .choice-check svg {
      width: 13px;
      height: 13px;
    }

    .fields-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 18px 12px;
    }

    .field--full {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }

    .field-label {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 5px;
      margin-bottom: 7px;
      color: var(--navy);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .required-mark {
      color: var(--coral-dark);
    }

    .control {
      position: relative;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .control > svg {
      position: absolute;
      left: 14px;
      z-index: 1;
      color: #8aa0b4;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    input,
    select {
      width: 100%;
      height: 48px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 8px;
      outline: 0;
      background: #ffffff;
      color: var(--ink);
      font-size: 13px;
      transition: border-color 160ms ease, box-shadow 160ms ease;
    }

    input {
      padding: 0 14px 0 44px;
    }

    select {
      padding: 0 42px 0 44px;
      appearance: none;
    }

    input::placeholder {
      color: #98aabd;
    }

    input:focus,
    select:focus {
      border-color: #7899ad;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(36, 113, 143, 0.11);
    }

    input.is-invalid,
    select.is-invalid {
      border-color: var(--danger);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(196, 61, 54, 0.09);
    }

    .select-arrow {
      right: 14px;
      left: auto !important;
      color: #8196a8 !important;
    }

    .password-control input {
      padding-right: 49px;
    }

    .password-toggle {
      position: absolute;
      right: 7px;
      width: 34px;
      height: 34px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      border: 0;
      border-radius: 6px;
      background: transparent;
      color: #7890a4;
    }

    .password-toggle:hover {
      background: var(--soft);
      color: var(--navy);
    }

    .password-toggle svg {
      width: 17px;
      height: 17px;
    }

    .field-message {
      display: none;
      margin: 6px 0 0;
      color: var(--danger);
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    .field.has-error .field-message {
      display: block;
    }

    .school-summary {
      padding: 17px;
      margin-top: 18px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: var(--soft);
    }

    .school-summary__head,
    .school-summary__meta {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .school-summary__head {
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .summary-code,
    .summary-tag {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 22px;
      padding: 0 8px;
      border-radius: 5px;
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .summary-code {
      background: var(--navy);
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    .summary-tag {
      margin-left: 4px;
      background: #daf4e9;
      color: var(--success);
    }

    .summary-status {
      color: var(--success);
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .school-summary__name {
      margin-top: 12px;
      color: var(--navy);
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .school-summary__meta {
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 12px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    .school-summary__meta span {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 5px;
    }

    .school-summary__meta svg {
      width: 14px;
      height: 14px;
      color: var(--coral-dark);
    }

    .notice {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 11px;
      padding: 14px;
      margin-top: 19px;
      border: 1px solid #f1d38b;
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: #fffaf0;
    }

    .notice > svg {
      margin-top: 1px;
      color: var(--warning);
    }

    .notice strong,
    .notice span {
      display: block;
    }

    .notice strong {
      color: #754d05;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .notice span {
      margin-top: 3px;
      color: #8b6c2d;
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    .terms-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 9px;
      margin-top: 21px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .terms-row input {
      width: 17px;
      height: 17px;
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      margin: 1px 0 0;
      accent-color: var(--coral);
    }

    .terms-row a {
      color: var(--coral-dark);
      text-decoration: underline;
      text-underline-offset: 2px;
    }

    .terms-row.has-error {
      color: var(--danger);
    }

    .step-error {
      padding: 12px 14px;
      margin-top: 20px;
      border: 1px solid #efb7b2;
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: #fff3f2;
      color: var(--danger);
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .form-actions {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      gap: 10px;
      padding-top: 25px;
      margin-top: 30px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .button {
      min-height: 46px;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 0 18px;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 800;
      transition: transform 160ms ease, background 160ms ease, border-color 160ms ease;
    }

    .button:hover {
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    .button:disabled {
      cursor: wait;
      opacity: 0.7;
      transform: none;
    }

    .button-primary {
      background: var(--coral);
      color: #ffffff;
      box-shadow: 0 9px 18px rgba(244, 81, 74, 0.19);
    }

    .button-primary:hover {
      background: var(--coral-dark);
    }

    .button-secondary {
      border-color: var(--line-dark);
      background: #ffffff;
      color: var(--navy);
    }

    .button-secondary:hover {
      border-color: #91a9b9;
      background: var(--soft);
    }

    .login-footer {
      margin: 24px 0 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .login-footer a {
      color: var(--coral-dark);
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .success-state {
      padding: 48px 10px 24px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .success-icon {
      width: 62px;
      height: 62px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      margin: 0 auto 20px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #daf4e9;
      color: var(--success);
    }

    .success-icon svg {
      width: 29px;
      height: 29px;
    }

    .success-state h2 {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--navy);
      font-size: 25px;
    }

    .success-state p {
      max-width: 390px;
      margin: 10px auto 24px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 1000px) {
      .register-shell {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .visual-panel {
        min-height: 300px;
        max-height: 360px;
      }

      .visual-copy {
        right: 28px;
        bottom: 28px;
        left: 28px;
      }

      .visual-copy h2 {
        font-size: 32px;
      }

      .form-panel {
        padding: 38px clamp(24px, 5vw, 54px) 30px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .topbar-inner,
      .page {
        width: min(100% - 28px, 1240px);
      }

      .topbar-inner {
        min-height: 64px;
      }

      .topbar-actions > span {
        display: none;
      }

      .brand {
        font-size: 11px;
      }

      .brand-mark {
        width: 36px;
        height: 36px;
      }

      .login-link {
        min-height: 38px;
        padding: 0 13px;
        font-size: 12px;
      }

      .page {
        margin-top: 15px;
        margin-bottom: 32px;
      }

      .visual-panel {
        min-height: 245px;
      }

      .visual-copy {
        right: 21px;
        bottom: 22px;
        left: 21px;
      }

      .visual-label {
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        font-size: 10px;
      }

      .visual-copy h2 {
        font-size: 28px;
      }

      .visual-copy p {
        display: none;
      }

      .form-panel {
        padding: 30px 18px 24px;
      }

      .form-header {
        display: block;
      }

      .step-count {
        padding-top: 12px;
      }

      .progress {
        margin: 25px 0 31px;
      }

      .progress-list {
        gap: 7px;
      }

      .progress-step {
        justify-content: center;
      }

      .progress-copy small {
        display: none;
      }

      .progress-copy strong {
        font-size: 11px;
      }

      .choice-grid,
      .choice-grid--roles,
      .fields-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .field--full {
        grid-column: auto;
      }

      .choice-card {
        min-height: 65px;
      }

      .form-actions {
        flex-direction: column-reverse;
      }

      .form-actions .button {
        width: 100%;
      }

      .school-summary__head {
        align-items: flex-start;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 9px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <header class="topbar">
    <div class="topbar-inner">
      <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="SIGRE — página inicial">
        <span class="brand-mark">
          <i data-lucide="graduation-cap"></i>
        </span>
        <span class="brand-name">
          SIGRE <strong>QUÊSSUA</strong>
        </span>
      </a>

      <div class="topbar-actions">
        <span>Já possui uma conta?</span>
        <a class="login-link" href="/login">
          Entrar
          <i data-lucide="arrow-right"></i>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="page">
    <section class="register-shell" aria-label="Criação de conta SIGRE">
      <aside class="visual-panel">
        <!-- Substitua esta imagem pela imagem oficial da sua instituição -->
        <img
          class="visual-image"
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544717305-2782549b5136?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1100&q=85"
          alt="Profissional de educação"
        >

        <div class="visual-cover"></div>

        <div class="visual-copy">
          <span class="visual-label">GESTÃO ESCOLAR</span>
          <h2>
            A sua escola,<br>
            <span>mais conectada.</span>
          </h2>
          <p>Uma única conta para gerir o seu acesso institucional.</p>
        </div>
      </aside>

      <section class="form-panel">
        <div class="form-header">
          <div>
            <span class="eyebrow">REGISTO INSTITUCIONAL</span>
